# perfcached-dashboard.sysusers - systemd-sysusers(8) declaration (DESIGN
# 12no).  perfcached-dashboard.service runs as User=perfcached-dashboard:
# its own account, not the daemon's, so the client secret in
# /etc/perfcached/perfcached-dashboard.conf is readable by the dashboard
# alone and a compromised dashboard owns nothing of the daemon's.
# Install as /usr/lib/sysusers.d/perfcached-dashboard.conf and run:
#
#     systemd-sysusers
u perfcached-dashboard - "perfcached dashboard" - -
